{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"## 2026-10-29 progress: 13 -> 10, and what the last 10 need\n\n**Done: the 2 strays (MISSING_CREATE x2 + FOREIGN_STORE_PATH).** `1022-d72f-4b89-49a3` and `af41-7784-737d-43e1` held only a gitignored `.cache.json` each (mtime 2026-09-12 22:23 PDT). They are the two planning tickets removed in the 2026-09-12 redaction: their CREATE commits are reachable only from `refs/tags/backup/tickets-pre-redaction`, and their original CREATE events are in the operator's local-only archive. The caches were copied there (sha256 verified), then removed with `rebar store maintenance --clean` (no --force; 0 unpushed commits). Backup ref `refs/rebar-maintenance/20261029T090716Z`, audit in the tracker gitdir.\n\n**Remaining, none fixable by repair alone:**\n\n1. **UNSIGNED_ENV (492a5c71, this operator host).** No signing identity exists here: no `.rebar/current_identity`, no `identity.signing_key`, no `REBAR_IDENTITY_SIGNING_KEY`, no SSH key in `~/.ssh`. Setting one up means choosing/creating key material and registering a public key in the shared store (docs/identity-setup.md). Past unsigned events stay unsigned; the finding stops only for new writes.\n2. **ENV_ID_MISMATCH (492a5c71 vs ade0f2ef, b8a354e0).** `env_identity.divergence_report` flags any author seen under more than one env id. Here every clone writes as the shared bot identity (AGENTS.md: shared credentials are a permanent operating constraint), so a healthy multi-clone store matches the \"re-clone\" signature. The docstring says it fires even for acknowledged changes, and it reads history that is never rewritten, so on this store fsck can never be clean. A fix needs a design choice (e.g. a recorded, store-committed acknowledgement of known sibling env ids).\n3. **8 ORPHAN_EVENTs on 6 tickets** (EDIT x4, FILE_IMPACT x2, STATUS, SIGNATURE). The repair classifies these as order-sensitive and leaves them for human triage."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793264962813980001,"uuid":"1fcf9fab-1f48-4fc4-ae4f-bc9ad8003cc0"}